-* `--packetrusher-version <version>`: Specify a **branch**, **tag**, or **commit hash** to use for PacketRusher (_default: [80a7f4bc63d9563a8ec58ba126440d94018a35a2](https://github.com/HewlettPackard/PacketRusher)_)
